<td colwidth="[559]" nodeId="8fe308e9141f4a9783636514873b65a9">
<p nodeId="26f96b31f884417fa42cd566ee768e07"><span font-size="15"><strong>【图/视】</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="2d1e492538ca433b890c49549f48100c"><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)"><strong>打标</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="aa1500e592cd4edaadd05b0c8564756e">1、AI生成图中，画面中<strong>人物</strong>的<strong>身体部位</strong>出现<strong>异常生成情形。</strong></p>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="677316543bd44022b7545f3b91300932">
<km-title>异常生成情形（不泛化）</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="848416fa173c463fb0f555427e8461dd">比例失调、数量错误、连接分离、形态扭曲、生成缺失、穿模</p>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
<p nodeId="c29fd24b46a34cbda44bd0f0580b57dd">2、AI生成图中，画面出现<strong>不完整的人体部位</strong>。</p>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="d944515f9bb94aa09d5d768ddc8c9d7a">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="852e1e6e3b3d414e86ba9de4810bb066"><strong>如何判断样本是否属于AI生成异常：</strong></p>
<ol nodeId="b94f1527cfb544c9a1bfa10796c40861">
<li nodeId="a391c37cdb454ebbac2e2e5d458c2eb1">
<p nodeId="7ad945fd4f9245959881234ed6477c66">若为模型输出type，无需判断，符合条件即打标AI生成生物异常</p>
<p nodeId="0d201cab8d0543599433bdd3fc3eff62">如type：100614 美境AI设计师多模审核<u>【大模型,AI生成】</u>，无需研判是否为AI生成。</p>
</li>
<li nodeId="f17fdd45b09f406b9ec3864a4732d668">
<p nodeId="223fd64388b14fea9352712e4e23d65f">非模型输出type，则以「是否符合常识」判断：</p>
<p nodeId="79938a75c65f43be9e44007e75dac88c"><strong>如断肢：</strong></p>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="5553597b575845c48bff533fa19e7487">
<km-title>若有血迹及断肢截面，则打重度引人不适</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="0cdcb86d94ef4c83b0b8f5a3250a5a9f"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2746422590/219668404009?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="" width="122" height="122" nodeId="9ff31114582e4d62bf785ba4168b0fd3" /></p>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="0f0969452a064c75ada66ce1f1662523">
<km-title>若无血迹及断肢截面，则打AI生成生物异常</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="c0acf06b27bc4af19063ff2b74063ebb"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2746422590/219667766653?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="" width="128" height="128" nodeId="96c31ba53042412097f5f9ebdd2cf748" /></p>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
<p nodeId="e14cd7aeb135402cbe2d06032c278e2d"><strong>如肢体扭曲：</strong></p>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="330b8094b4b74e57a9aa5c639301e685">
<km-title>若有皮肤病变痕迹，则打重度引人不适</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="d78e6887268d4744a64a75859df10763"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2746422590/219664053949?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="" width="146" height="81" nodeId="74fd4fd631724bf09ae0e72e1d288cee" /></p>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="60f4157cb7c946669cc836c1d5dcf321">
<km-title>若无皮肤病变痕迹，则打AI生成生物异常</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="3e3e24fb69174d25aba1e0415d0af869"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2746422590/219663095167?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="" width="123" height="105" nodeId="d602bb1ed164468cbad7ee103adf142b" /></p>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
</li>
</ol>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="74fcfe1c1c934d2383eebde5094b42b6" />
<p nodeId="5d467dd66d3249379dbaf7a188a9ce00"><span color="#00BA73"><strong>不打标</strong></span></p>
<km-note type="warning" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="e846a672df4242a297900d4ec3a3fa43">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="f666ebb0fc2a4a8787fa1423088c7ff0"><span color="#000"><span font-size="13"><strong>注意：</strong></span></span><span color="#000"><span font-size="13">以下情况无需打此标，若同时命中其他内容安全风险，按优先级打标</span></span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="37a0693aa37949aba698d055559dce90">1、AI生成图中，由于自然因素或艺术设定，致使人体部位产生变化，但<strong>符合常识逻辑判断</strong>的，可豁免此标签，如：哪吒三头六臂。</p>
<p nodeId="406aba90ce5548ce8acfdac7ba2274f5">2、AI生成图中，出现以下情形，可豁免此标签：</p>
<ul nodeId="a84f3d9dff7d432bb53f91cf208d1628">
<li nodeId="4f02ab618ac14a878a6313333998b88c"><strong>疑似乳头部位</strong>生成异常，但无法明确为乳头的，如不立体或无颜色</li>
<li nodeId="181a2cbc1acc494987f28421c91df777"><strong>衣物</strong>生成异常</li>
</ul>
</td>
