<h4 nodeId="aa477002912b4a7a90233a1ff1759a85"><strong>AI生成菜品异常</strong></h4>
</td>
<td colwidth="[92]" nodeId="ccd5ac2c74e048d59b997dd4ee6f5613">
<h5 nodeId="85d962e308664f43affe3cd7ca04756d">菜品材质性质异常</h5>
</td>
<td colwidth="[559]" nodeId="8bc20479b1f7488480f2d6424c4785c4">
<p nodeId="4d55129bff8a4566b0e9e2899ff165f3"><span font-size="15"><strong>【图/视】</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="37c57c54e5f04355b4f0e8f6197bfc06"><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)"><strong>打标</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="d37690ab25db4a2a882e332eea1b4d9c">1、AI生成菜品图中，主体展示或核心区域出现菜品<strong>材质异常</strong></p>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="b171f6beda4a45fbab6f536dbdc8cf1e">
<km-title><strong>材质异常</strong>（定义不泛化，样本可泛化）</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="8907e3b965b748258bfaec41d853e0ff"><strong>定义：</strong>食材的材质，与现实中该食材普遍认知下的材质明显不符</p>
<p nodeId="a9b5aad3-8f64-45d9-9584-eadc16657f12"><strong>举例：</strong></p>
<p nodeId="c160ba85-2ec4-43ab-8d33-03d60edf097e">纹理不符：食材呈现宝石切面、机械纹路等非食物纹理</p>
<p nodeId="132e8368-9408-4622-b320-a0650b460530">硬度不符：硬质食材呈现出可拉伸性状</p>
<p nodeId="ab4c5f22-b02f-404c-8e18-41df67b2a364">结构不符：食材呈现异形结构</p>
<p nodeId="80099b80-7418-42bc-97bd-b6ac58e5150b">色泽不符：食材呈现夸张色泽</p>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
<p nodeId="197a037c55094f3f8d1a231b27fa0bd3">2、AI生成菜品图中，出现菜品<strong>物理性质异常</strong></p>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="13737883bf874bceb594e31466cceb16">
<km-title><strong>物理性质异常</strong>（不泛化）</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="321518e63f304e3bbb85a6ad1d5348c0">死肉活眼：本该是熟食，食材眼睛却如活物般鲜活</p>
<p nodeId="73b2a70868284bc7aa87a14424bf1931">熟菜生肉：本该是熟食，肉类食材却呈现生食质感</p>
<p nodeId="689a9b1396404f239eb04169d7d326ed">生食热气：本该是冷食，却散发热食的蒸汽</p>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
<p nodeId="8006fb7922aa4f8e960406b8601dbfa2" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[574]" nodeId="4645347ed12d4d89b628bda112327e73">
